WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.587 --> 00:00:04.588
Okay.

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:10.135
Some people think my music
is dope.

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:14.556
Some people see me as, like,
this Satanic devil.

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:17.351
But me?

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:26.068
When I was a kid,
my sexuality was just, like,

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.569
the elephant in the room.

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.780
I started getting like bad,
like, anxiety attacks.

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:30.823
On God...

00:00:30.906 --> 00:00:33.742
Coming out was
very important to progress.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.953
Just put out
"Old Town Road"...

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.704
Let me hit y’all back
a year from now.

00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:42.459
We gon' see
where I'm at.

00:00:43.127 --> 00:00:45.003
My mind is hardwired
since a kid,

00:00:45.129 --> 00:00:48.048
when you fuck up, you have
to quit the whole thing.

00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:50.968
I feel like there's
something brewing

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.344
that's gonna be so amazing.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.430
I trust that feeling.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.768
I'm not, like, able to be
100 percent

00:00:59.852 --> 00:01:00.978
around, like,
family members.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.315
I feel like there's
a lot of things

00:01:05.399 --> 00:01:07.151
that people may want to say,
but don't.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.403
I'm always just trying
to challenge the way

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:11.822
my family, like, looks
at things.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.283
I'm gonna teach my nephews
to not be homophobic.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.326
-Hey. Hey, y'all.
-What?

00:01:16.452 --> 00:01:18.245
Don't...
don't be homophobic.

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:20.205
Okay...

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.250
So many queer people

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:27.129
are making these huge
strides but it's a fight.

00:01:28.464 --> 00:01:29.465
Hello, family.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.884
It's like, crazy to walk out
in front of like,

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:34.386
both sides of your family
in, like, this little skirt.

00:01:34.887 --> 00:01:35.763
I’m like: what's up, Dad?

00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:45.481
There's still
parts of myself

00:01:45.564 --> 00:01:48.192
that I'm learning to accept.

00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:50.235
But we're getting closer.

